'Start the summarization per subplot' step runs for each protein. (Models by protein, one by one protein) I guess that certain protein has many measurements (many peptides or fragments). I can see the range of the number of peptides per protein is 1 to 461. I guess that MSstats was modeling for the protein with a large number of peptides, like 461. There is no faster way to fit the model for one protein. I could recommend using top N peptides. It will be faster.

